         <patent:Title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Power supply device with a blocking oscillator</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="de">Leistungsversorgungseinrichtung mit Sperr-Schwingkreis</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="en">Power supply device with a blocking oscillator</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="fr">Dispositif d'alimentation de puissance Ã  oscillateur de blocage</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </patent:Title>
         <patent:Abstract>
            <rdf:Seq>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="en">A non-interfering power supply device includes a free-running blocking oscillator (10) power supply subsystem and a circuit arrangement (12) that synchronizes the blocking oscillator power supply subsystem to operate at the horizontal operating frequency of a display subsystem. Synchronizing signals representative of the horizontal operating frequency of the display subsystem are generated and are used to activate the circuit arrangement that causes the blocking oscillator (10) to change its mode of operation from free-running to a fully reset fixed frequency flyback converter. When activated, a switch (18) in the circuit arrangement (12) extends the off-time of a switching transistor (Q1) in the blocking oscillator (10). As a result, the latter is forced to run at an operating frequency lower than its free-running frequency.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Seq>
         </patent:Abstract>
